TOKNCLAW SIGNAL ENGINE
Solana Strategy Allocator Engine

Purpose
-------
Aggregates multiple Solana strategy engines into a unified trade
decision layer.

This module converts:
• dip strategy signals
• momentum strategy signals
• migration strategy signals
• alpha confirmations
• narrative confirmations
• liquidity warnings

Into:
• ranked trade decisions
• candidate trade queue
• avoid decisions
• allocator summary output

Responsibilities
----------------
• read local signal lake only
• discover active strategy signals
• score candidate tokens across multiple strategy families
• support conflict resolution
• support future strategy expansion through config
• emit allocator outputs for paper trading and future live execution
• remain additive to the ToknClaw architecture
• remain OpenClaw agent ready

Design Notes
------------
• no direct RPC calls
• strategy families are registry/config driven
• future strategy classes can be added without rewriting allocator core
• allocator emits decisions, not actual orders

Primary Input
-------------
/opt/toknclaw/data/signal_lake.json

Primary Output
--------------
Signals returned into snapshot pipeline

Agent Readiness
---------------
OpenClaw agents should tune:
• /opt/toknclaw/config/solana_strategy_allocator_engine.json

Author: TOKN Systems
"""

